{"id":10068,"name":"gallade-mega","speciesId":475,"dex":475,"form":"mega","generation":4,"types":["psychic","fighting"],"stats":{"hp":68,"attack":165,"defense":95,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":115,"speed":110},"abilities":[{"name":"inner-focus","hidden":false}],"height":16,"weight":564,"baseExp":278,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10068.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10068.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10068.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10068.ogg","genus":"Blade Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Lâmina","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."},{"version":"platinum","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce."},{"version":"sword","text":"True to its honorable-warrior image, it uses the blades on its elbows only in defense of something or someone."},{"version":"shield","text":"Sharply attuned to others’ wishes for help, this Pokémon seeks out those in need and aids them in battle."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"The blades extending from its elbows are sharper than the finest swords. Its swordsmanship, albeit self-taught, is astonishingly impressive."}],"flavorPt":"As lâminas que se estendem desde os cotovelos são mais afiadas que as espadas mais finas. Sua esgrima, embora autodidata, é surpreendentemente impressionante.","genderRate":0,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["humanshape","indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"ralts","speciesId":280,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["N